   Yu, Gang; Wang, Yongjuan; Lin, Jian; Wang, Xiangyu, Informat Sci \& Technol Inst, Henan Key Lab Network Cryptog Technol, Zhengzhou 450001, Henan, Peoples R China.
   Cao, Zhenfu, East China Normal Univ, Shanghai Key Lab Trustworthy Comp, Shanghai 200062, Peoples R China.},
DOI = {10.1177/1550147719841276},
Article-Number = {1550147719841276},
ISSN = {1550-1477},
