Pages = {3219-3237},
Month = {JUN 30},
Abstract = {The Cloud Computing is growing rapidly in the current IT industry. Cloud
   computing has become a buzzword in relation to Grid \& Utility
   computing. It provides on demand services to customers and customers
   will pay for what they get. Various ``Cloud Service Provider{''} such as
   Microsoft Azure, Google Web Services etc. enables the users to access
   the cloud in cost effective manner. However, security, privacy and
   integrity of data is a major concern. In this paper various security
   challenges have been identified and the survey briefs the comprehensive
   overview of various security issues in cloud computing. The
   classification of security issues in cloud computing have been studied.
   In this paper we have discussed security challenges in cloud computing
   and also list recommended methods available for addressing them in the
   literature.},
